==Swedish==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|sv|/sloː/|[sl̪oə̯]}}
* {{audio|sv|Sv-slå.ogg}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|sv|gmq-osw|sla|slā}}, from {{inh|sv|non|slá}}, from {{inh|sv|gem-pro|*slahaną}}, from {{der|sv|ine-pro|*slak-||to hit, strike, throw}}.

====Verb====
{{sv-verb-irr|slår|slog|slagit|slå}}

# to [[hit]], [[punch]] or [[beat]] (someone); to give a [[blow]]. {{C|sv|Hit}}
# to [[strike]]; to hit, especially with some kind of tool.
# {{lb|sv|of a clock}} to strike
#: {{ux|sv|Klockan har just '''slagit''' tre.|The clock has just '''struck''' three.}}
# to [[defeat]]; to [[win]] against; to [[beat]]
#: {{ux|sv|Hon '''slog''' världsrekordsinnehavaren|She '''beat''' the world record holder}}
# to [[break]] a [[record]]
#: {{ux|sv|Hon har '''slagit''' världsrekord!|She has '''broken''' a world record!}}
# to become a [[hit]], to become very popular
# to [[throw]] a [[die]]
# to [[pour]]
#: {{syn|sv|hälla}}
#: {{ux|sv|'''Slå''' mjölk i soppan|'''Pour''' milk into the soup}}
#: {{ux|sv|'''Slå''' i mera mjöd, det får bli min död|'''Pour''' in more mead, I'll let it be my death}}
# {{lb|sv|certain board games}} to [[capture]], to [[take]] one of the opponent's pieces out of play
#: {{ux|sv|I schack är kungen den enda pjäs som inte får '''slås'''.|In chess, the king is the only piece which may not '''be taken'''.}}
# {{lb|sv|in "slå knut"}} to [[tie]] or [[form]] a (often figurative) [[knot]]
#: {{syn|sv|knyta}}
# to [[cut]], to [[mow]] (with a scythe)

